From bd3416417bbcdd4086a0d80600a24a59ab7dc305 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 22:54:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] TileLang WO projection kernels

The MXFP8 GEMM gains a groups parameter, so one launch covers every WO-A
group; with one group it compiles to the same code as before.
TileLangWOProjection chains inverse RoPE in place, grouped WO-A and WO-B on the
checkpoint tensors and names its weights for the L2 prefetch, which now asks a
projection for its bytes when it can. No caller yet.
